#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:75
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are no build-time requirements for this package; however, it is "
"designed to be controlled by a cron daemon such as <xref linkend=\"fcron\" "
"role=\"runtime\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Não existem requisitos de tempo de construção para esse pacote; entretanto, "
"ele foi projetado para ser controlado por um processo de segundo plano "
"\"cron\", como o <xref linkend=\"fcron\" role=\"runtime\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:83
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Sysstat"
msgstr "Instalação do \"Sysstat\""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:86
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Sysstat</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>Sysstat</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:90
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sa_lib_dir=/usr/lib/sa    \\\n"
"sa_dir=/var/log/sa        \\\n"
"conf_dir=/etc/sysstat     \\\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr \\\n"
"            --disable-file-attr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sa_lib_dir=/usr/lib/sa    \\\n"
"sa_dir=/var/log/sa        \\\n"
"conf_dir=/etc/sysstat     \\\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr \\\n"
"            --disable-file-attr &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a working test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste funcional."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:105
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:108
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install the systemd unit by running the following commands as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Instale a unidade do \"systemd\" executando os seguintes comandos como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:112
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 sysstat.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat.service                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-collect.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat-collect.service &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-collect.timer /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat-collect.timer     &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-rotate.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat-roate.service    &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-rotate.timer /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat-rotate.timer       &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-summary.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat-summary.service &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-summary.timer /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat-summary.timer</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -m644 sysstat.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/"
"sysstat.service                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-collect.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/"
"sysstat-collect.service &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-collect.timer /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat-"
"collect.timer     &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-rotate.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat-"
"roate.service    &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-rotate.timer /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat-"
"rotate.timer       &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-summary.service /usr/lib/systemd/system/"
"sysstat-summary.service &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 cron/sysstat-summary.timer /usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat-"
"summary.timer</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Fix the systemd unit by running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Corrija a unidade do \"systemd\" executando o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:125
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i \"/^Also=/d\" "
"/usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat.service</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i \"/^Also=/d\" "
"/usr/lib/systemd/system/sysstat.service</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:130
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<envar>sa_lib_dir</envar>: This environment variable specifies the location "
"of the package-specific library directory."
msgstr ""
"<envar>sa_lib_dir</envar>: Essa variável de ambiente especifica o local do "
"diretório específico do pacote da biblioteca."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<envar>sa_dir</envar>: This environment variable specifies the location of "
"the directory containing the data files."
msgstr ""
"<envar>sa_dir</envar>: Essa variável de ambiente especifica o local do "
"diretório que contém os arquivos de dados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<envar>conf_dir</envar>: This environment variable specifies the location of"
" the system configuration directory."
msgstr ""
"<envar>conf_dir</envar>: Essa variável de ambiente especifica o local do "
"diretório do sistema da configuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-file-attr</parameter>: Do not set attributes on files "
"being installed. This parameter causes the installation to ignore the man "
"group variable resulting in the man files having <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>: <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">root</systemitem> ownership."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-file-attr</parameter>: Não configure atributos nos "
"arquivos sendo instalados. Esse parâmetro faz com que a instalação ignore a "
"variável do grupo \"man\", resultando nos arquivos de manual tendo a "
"titularidade da propriedade <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>: <systemitem "
"class=\"groupname\">root</systemitem>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Run <command>./configure --help</command> to see other influential "
"environment variables you can pass to <command>configure</command>.  You may"
" want to use the <envar>history</envar> and <envar>compressafter</envar> "
"variables to customize the amount of data files kept on the system."
msgstr ""
"Execute <command>./configure --help</command> para ver outras variáveis de "
"ambiente influentes que você possa passar para o "
"<command>configure</command>. Você possivelmente queira usar as variáveis "
"<envar>history</envar> e <envar>compressafter</envar> para personalizar a "
"quantidade de arquivos de dados mantidos no sistema."

