#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/sysstat.xml:333
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"is used for displaying the contents of data files created by the "
"<command>sar</command> command. But unlike <command>sar</command>, "
"<command>sadf</command> can write its data in many different formats"
msgstr ""
"é usado para exibir o conteúdo dos arquivos de dados criados pelo comando "
"<command>sar</command>. Mas diferentemente do <command>sar</command>, o "
"<command>sadf</command> pode escrever os dados dele em muitos formatos"

